<h2 style="text-align: center; background-color: #08d9d6;">MEMBERSHIP </h2>
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-3" style="background-color:#d3d3d3 ;text-align:center">
    <a class="btn btn-dark" style="margin-top:20px" href="membershipsss">Membership Registration Form</a><br>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="MembersofMechatronicsClub" style="margin-top:30px">Members of Mechatronics Club</a>

  </div>
  <div class="col-8" style="padding-left:100px;padding-right:100px;text-align: justify;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center; background-color: #ff2e63;"">RULES AND REGULATIONS</h3>
    
    
    <h5>Membership</h5>
    <li class="list-group-item padlist"> 
    <p>Any Marian Engineering College student can apply for the membership of Mechatronics Club.</li>
      <li class="list-group-item padlist"> A nominal fee decided by the core comitee will be collected as registration fee at the time of joining.</p></li>
<h5>Benefits of Joining Club</h5>
<li  class="list-group-item padlist">
<p>Mechatronics Club have a workspace were you can use a large number of microcontroller boards like arduino, raspberry pi, nodemcu ,other electronics devices, sensors,drives etc , mechanical tools like welding  machine ,grinding ,drilling and other mechanical tools also we have computer facility. </p></li>
<li  class="list-group-item padlist"><p>Students of club gets a price reduction for various events conducted by the club.</p></li>
<li  class="list-group-item padlist"><p>Students gets project development assist from the club coordinators and other members.</p></li>
    <h5>Core committee Members.</h5>
    <li  class="list-group-item padlist"><p>The Governing Council is elected to manage the affairs of the Club. It consists of </li><li  class="list-group-item padlist">President -1 <br>  Vice – Presidents – 1 <br>  Secretary – 1 <br>  Treasurer – 1 <br>   Media Coordinator-2 <br>  Management Coordinator-2 <br>  Program Coordinator-2 <br>   Technical Coordinator-2 <br> Department Coordinator-5 <br> Staff Incharge-1 <br> Staff departmental coordinators-5 <br></li> <li  class="list-group-item padlist">the elected members have a time period of 1 year to show their potentials in club by organizing programs like workshops , competitions  ,industrial visits,Seminars, and other activities. </p></li>
    <h5>Duties and Responsibilities</h5>
    <p><b>President</b> 
    <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To preside over the meetings of the Club </li><li  class="list-group-item padlist">To issue instructions and directions club To advice the Club about its activities.</li><b>Vice President </b> <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To assist the President to execute his functions effectively</li><li  class="list-group-item padlist">  To execute the functions of the President in his absence </li><b>Secretary</b>  <li  class="list-group-item padlist"> <br> To keep and maintain the records, registers, accounts, and files of the Club</li>
    <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To convene the meetings of the Youth Club in consultation with the President <br></li>
      <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To look after the day to day functioning ofthe Club </li>
        <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To receive and send letters and other communications on behalf of the Club. <br></li>
<b>Treasurer </b> <li  class="list-group-item padlist">To operate joint accounts of Club and transaction of money with the concurrence of the executive committee.<br></li>
</p>



